        <item>
            <title>0.15.92</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:25:10 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>253</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.92</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>With Bluetooth headphones, recording could fail to start in 0.15.91 (most often during a call). The microphone choice is back to how it was in 0.15.90 while a better fix is finished.</li>
<li>Starting a recording or catching a call with Bluetooth headphones no longer freezes Corder&#x27;s window and menu for a few seconds.</li>
<li>When an AI assistant asks Corder to transcribe a file on this Mac, the audio is never sent to the cloud, even while the on-device model is still downloading.</li>
<li>In the dark theme, a selected session that was transcribed from a file is highlighted in blue instead of green, and the dot of the selected session is white.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
